            start a fresh round — guaranteeing equal participation before anyone
            repeats.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            Do I need to rebuild it every lesson?<span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-a">
            No. Once your class list is added, save a shareable link to the
